        "TileImage": "$($repository 29f32abf-80a4-4807-9818-5171d14f19c7).Image",
        "Description": "47, you are in charge of a new FTL: Faster Than Light mission. Your targets are Toby Hicks, Jackie and Julian Carrington, Jordan Cross and Dexy Barat. This group is behind one of the largest embezzlement schemes in the city. It enjoys strong protection from high-ranking officials within various institutions who have been paid to keep quiet and divert the attention of law enforcement. Find these individuals and dismantle this group before an unprecedented crisis erupts. Be careful and good luck.",
